{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "73be20cb-874e-818b-b303-1168ac825c78",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T14:48:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:44:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:44:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey, hi, Greg. Um, my name's Sal Mancini? I'm calling for my mom, actually, she's at 441 Pelham Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:44:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 441 Pelham. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:44:29-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So she's putting in a pool, like an in-ground one in the back yard, and I'm helping her figure out the barrier stuff? Like the rules for keeping it safe, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:44:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Pools have barrier requirements, so a fence or something around it. Is the pool itself already permitted, or are you still planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still planning, totally. We're just trying to get the fence part sorted first. We're thinking black aluminum, like the picket style, four feet tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:45:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Four feet is on the low side for a pool barrier, I'll say that up front. I'd want you to confirm the required height before you buy anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:45:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, really? Huh. Okay. So, like, what are the rules on fences in general? Do we need paperwork for it, or can we just put it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:45:37-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a fence needs a permit, and a pool barrier definitely does. It usually goes along with the pool permit application. And since you're on Historic Hill, depending on where the house sits there might be an extra review for how it looks from the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a permit, yes. Got it. Wait, would that extra review apply if the fence is only in the back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:46:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Back yard is less likely to be an issue, but I can't tell you for sure without the address on a map. Someone here can check that when you apply."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:46:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cool. And how close to the property line can it go? Like, can it be right on the line, or does it have to be set back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:46:40-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a setback question, and it can differ for fences versus the pool itself. Typically you'd want a survey or a plot plan showing where the line actually is. Don't just eyeball it off the neighbor's fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that makes sense. The neighbors are super chill, honestly. They take turns grabbing each other's mail when someone's on vacation, so I don't think it'll be a fight. I just don't want to put it in the wrong spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:47:18-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good plan. Talk to them anyway, it saves headaches. Now for the exact setback number I'd rather have the inspector look at your lot. Do you want me to leave a note for someone to call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:47:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'd be great. Should I call back, or can they call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:47:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll have them call. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:47:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0183, Sal Mancini, for 441 Pelham Street. Pool and fence permit questions, setbacks, and the barrier height."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:48:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Should I bring anything when we apply? Like the survey you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, bring the survey or plot plan if you have one, a drawing of the pool and fence location, and the fence details, so the material and height. The person calling back will go through the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Awesome. Okay, that's super helpful. Thanks, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye."
    }
  ],
